{
  "id": "6a8509133719ba3bd8e6da75",
  "title": "穴のメタファー",
  "created": 1787103511,
  "updated": 1787144150,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a8509133719ba3bd8e6da75",
      "text": "穴のメタファー",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787103511,
      "updated": 1787103511
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85091600000000000f34f6",
      "text": "[赤リンクの穴を埋める]など",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787103511,
      "updated": 1787103521
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85091d00000000000f34f7",
      "text": "> 穴の中に飛び込むには勇気が必要",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787103518,
      "updated": 1787109061
    },
    {
      "id": "6a851ec00000000000241b3a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787109057,
      "updated": 1787109068
    },
    {
      "id": "6a851ecb0000000000241b3c",
      "text": "穴が空いているからこそ先を見通せるという捉え方もある",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787109068,
      "updated": 1787109112
    },
    {
      "id": "6a852013000000000076fa21",
      "text": " 異なる空間を繋ぐ[ポータル]としての穴",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787109397,
      "updated": 1787109451
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85232f0000000000bc9995",
      "text": "  [通りぬけフープ]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787110193,
      "updated": 1787110200
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8523de0000000000ea0c04",
      "text": "  移動する",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787110367,
      "updated": 1787110369
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8523e10000000000ea0c05",
      "text": "  覗き見る",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787110370,
      "updated": 1787110374
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8523e50000000000ea0c06",
      "text": "  取り出す",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787110374,
      "updated": 1787110380
    },
    {
      "id": "6a851ef80000000000241b3d",
      "text": " デライトに対してこの意味合いでメタファーを用いたことがある[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787109113,
      "updated": 1787109234
    },
    {
      "id": "6a851f820000000000241b3e",
      "text": "  [デライトの穴 https://dlt.kitetu.com/KNo.FD7E/CFA8]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787109251,
      "updated": 1787109789
    },
    {
      "id": "6a851ec80000000000241b3b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787109065,
      "updated": 1787109065
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85226f0000000000409288",
      "text": "井戸も穴か",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1787109999,
      "updated": 1787110004
    },
    {
      "id": "6a852279000000000040928a",
      "text": " 井戸端は井戸の周りにあり井戸は穴の一種なので井戸端には穴が含まれている",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1787110009,
      "updated": 1787110036
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8522710000000000409289",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1787110002,
      "updated": 1787110002
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85a7aa0000000000f5a316",
      "text": "[ラビットホール] - [不思議の国のアリス]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787144106,
      "updated": 1787144150
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85a7b50000000000f5a317",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787144118,
      "updated": 1787144118
    }
  ]
}